    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have this crazy pain in my side again. like it's shooting down into my groin. i've had kidney stones way before so i think it might just be that happening again but i also noticed my stomach feels like it's pulsing a bit? is that normal with stones or should i be worried about something else??",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
