      "content": "idk i'm just kinda scared to go to the er cuz it's so expensive and it really feels like my old stones. the pulsing is weird though, it's like i can feel my heartbeat in my belly area. do u think i could just take some extra ibuprofen and some of these herbal kidney flush supplements i have to see if it goes away first? i really dont wanna go to the hospital if i dont have to",
